node.doctext:
I have a script that allows an user to enter a word to search for files on a directory.  The problem comes when it returns values where the word is not at the beginning.  I tried the ^ and \A and they will not return any results at all.  Any assistance would be greatly appreciated.

<code> 
my $pattern = "^audit";  #No results
#my $pattern = "\Aaudit"; #No results

@dir_files = grep { $_ =~ /$pattern/ } @dir_files;
 for my $list(@dir_files){
   print "$list\n";
 }
</code>
